/// Shared hk preset for risu729 projects.
/// Consumers: `amends "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/risu729/hk-config/<version>/presets.pkl"`
/// then set `steps = helpers.pick(...)` in `hk.pkl`.
amends "package://github.com/jdx/hk/releases/download/v2.0.0/hk@2.0.0#/Config.pkl"

min_hk_version = "2.0.0"
